<title>The Sahel insurgency: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sahel/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sahel-2026-10-20T13:43:44.245Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 13:43:44 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Malian armed men stormed camps in the Menaka region, killing more than forty civilians in attacks attributed to Islamic State-linked militants. In Nigeria, gunmen attacked a convoy in Borno, killing fifteen soldiers and task force members, and terrorists killed soldiers at a Borno military post. Bandits raided two communities in Niger, causing scores of deaths. Mali’s military and allied armed groups continue to commit abuses against civilians. The conflict caused 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxQekJZS0Nab2NieDNYRjhYdU1xQXduZ1pwUGREVjdKZl96eWV1TGdrSEJPOUJVODlZdnpmVUJ4eVNFZXpxZk5zY1dESlUxWDVZSnNueXVsTVFRY0V0djFRSEtibDMyOURzT3FUaFV6ekUzejVuQVJMR2VlRGh2THZWUUI5cEtvdnZUYzg0Qm8ycUctMGVHVWo1QnRR?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxPSEFCNnd6V2xJdVlMUUNvVDN2aEo0LUdOU2xmQUxPUTM5TDB0SFRVZFNOZ0NZbTc5Tmp0c1FfR1M4N0owVjJucFc5MHpEMjlhd1ZwVjJPdnp0WjNMLV8xS1RWdXJEQUxYMTBGXzFaVENoTkRCZnBsbTVaRXZ2ZjRsYTJnMEtmZUJURnFZZFdlLTYzTVU?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Arab Weekly&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Economic Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxNNjF4cWJYYjhuSkdrdFVCVlI1SzJkbnBMb0RuOXcyN2J3MnNmbG5CbFowcDJhdFVTRmpSRnhWUHN0RWNxRVRwTTVjRnM0WFJ6N0x2NzlaUkpIcEVaaWwtQWZMdGoydzJqY0lRcDBNUW5lZmtERW5RZjZwSVo1YjFLTjV1NXBLZTBwVWtJR0JmZjMzNEp4MjhyWk5laHNSRHE2TUZaei0zN19PQkdWSjBzNDFmZUcwblBjaHhpcDMxeTB0cldtbTRj?oc=5&quot;&gt;Seneweb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTFBkWmlPSGY1VTIzdFFZZk1TOGpoUFBKRTM4aERhSTZlT0RjRHdsMi1JR2wzNVpaRTZ3VHBza3pPVGVtek9iZHJnMHRoVUFGTE9f?oc=5&quot;&g